// A stored concept keeps rank, lexical, and hamming.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE rank  ROLE observer   PROTON 1
CUBE plate ROLE kernel_sot PROTON 1

PLUG rank plate

IMPULSE rank 1
IMPULSE plate 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY plate
DECIDE plate
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "score" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
